function sumLines(D){const L=[[D.t,36,1,"#0f5a41"],["أساسيات علوم المحاصيل – ملخص شامل",26,0,"#555"],["",14]];
 D.s.forEach(x=>{L.push([x[0],30,1,"#c2410c"]);x[1].split("|").forEach(p=>L.push(["• "+p,26,0,"#111",24]));L.push(["",12])});
 L.push([CREF[0],28,1,"#0f5a41"]);CREF.slice(1).forEach(r=>L.push([r,24,0,"#111",24]));return L}
function mapCanvas(D){
 const W=800,P=28,col=["#0f766e","#c2410c","#1d4ed8","#7e22ce","#b91c1c","#a16207","#047857","#be185d"];
 const mc=document.createElement("canvas").getContext("2d"),F=(s,b)=>(b?"bold ":"")+s+"px Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif";
 const wrap=(t,w,s,b)=>{mc.font=F(s,b);const o=[];let l="";t.split(" ").forEach(x=>{const y=l?l+" "+x:x;if(mc.measureText(y).width>w&&l){o.push(l);l=x}else l=y});if(l)o.push(l);return o};
 const key=p=>{const i=p.indexOf(":"),k=i>0&&i<80?p.slice(0,i):p,w=k.split(" ");return w.length>14?w.slice(0,14).join(" ")+" …":k};
 const LW=W-2*P-60,BW=W-2*P,br=[0];let y=P;const it=[];
 const rl=wrap(D.t,BW-40,34,1),rh=rl.length*46+30;it.push({r:1,y,h:rh,l:rl});y+=rh+30;
 D.s.forEach((sec,i)=>{const hl=wrap(sec[0],BW-40,30,1),hh=hl.length*40+24,b={b:1,i,y,h:hh,l:hl,lv:[]};br.push(y);y+=hh+10;
  sec[1].split("|").forEach(p=>{const ll=wrap(key(p),LW-30,26,0),lh=ll.length*34+18;b.lv.push({y,h:lh,l:ll});br.push(y);y+=lh+8});y+=18;it.push(b)});
 const H=y+P-10,cv=document.createElement("canvas");cv.width=W;cv.height=H;const cx=cv.getContext("2d");
 cx.fillStyle="#fff";cx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);cx.direction="rtl";cx.textAlign="center";cx.textBaseline="middle";
 const rr=(x,y,w,h,r)=>{cx.beginPath();cx.moveTo(x+r,y);cx.arcTo(x+w,y,x+w,y+h,r);cx.arcTo(x+w,y+h,x,y+h,r);cx.arcTo(x,y+h,x,y,r);cx.arcTo(x,y,x+w,y,r);cx.closePath()};
 const tx=(ls,xm,y0,h,s,b,c)=>{cx.font=F(s,b);cx.fillStyle=c;const lh=h/ls.length;ls.forEach((l,j)=>cx.fillText(l,xm,y0+lh*(j+.5)))};
 it.forEach(o=>{if(o.r){rr(P,o.y,BW,o.h,22);cx.fillStyle="#0f5a41";cx.fill();tx(o.l,W/2,o.y,o.h,34,1,"#fff");return}
  const c=col[o.i%col.length],sx=W-P-30;
  if(o.lv.length){const last=o.lv[o.lv.length-1];cx.strokeStyle=c;cx.lineWidth=3;cx.beginPath();cx.moveTo(sx,o.y+o.h);cx.lineTo(sx,last.y+last.h/2);cx.stroke();
   o.lv.forEach(v=>{cx.beginPath();cx.moveTo(sx,v.y+v.h/2);cx.lineTo(P+LW,v.y+v.h/2);cx.stroke();rr(P,v.y,LW,v.h,12);cx.fillStyle=c+"1f";cx.fill();cx.strokeStyle=c;cx.lineWidth=2;cx.stroke();tx(v.l,P+LW/2,v.y,v.h,26,0,"#111")})}
  rr(P,o.y,BW,o.h,16);cx.fillStyle=c;cx.fill();tx(o.l,W/2,o.y,o.h,30,1,"#fff")});
 cv.br=br;return cv}
async function mapPages(cv){const H=cv.height,PH=1120,br=cv.br.concat([H]),pgs=[];let s=0;
 while(s<H){let e;if(H-s<=PH)e=H;else{const c=br.filter(b=>b>s+200&&b<=s+PH);e=c.length?Math.max(...c):s+PH}
  const c=document.createElement("canvas");c.width=cv.width;c.height=e-s;const g=c.getContext("2d");g.fillStyle="#fff";g.fillRect(0,0,c.width,c.height);g.drawImage(cv,0,s,cv.width,e-s,0,0,cv.width,e-s);pgs.push(await toJpg(c));s=e}
 return pgs}
function docView(f,back){
 const {k,n,m}=f.doc,D=CR[k][n],nm=KINDS[k][2]+"_"+n;
 if(m==="s"){
  page(`<h2>${esc(D.t)}</h2><button class="btn" id="sv">⬇️ تحميل الملخص (PDF)</button><button class="btn alt" id="pr">🖨️ طباعة</button><div class="msg" id="ms"></div>`+D.s.map(x=>`<h3 style="color:var(--pri);margin:16px 0 4px">${esc(x[0])}</h3><ul style="padding-right:20px;margin:0">${x[1].split("|").map(p=>`<li>${esc(p)}</li>`).join("")}</ul>`).join("")+`<h3 style="color:var(--pri);margin:16px 0 4px">${CREF[0]}</h3><ul style="padding-right:20px;margin:0">${CREF.slice(1).map(r=>`<li>${esc(r.slice(2))}</li>`).join("")}</ul>`,back);
  const ms=document.getElementById("ms"),mk=()=>textPDF(sumLines(D));
  document.getElementById("sv").onclick=()=>dl(ms,"ملخص_"+nm+".pdf",mk);document.getElementById("pr").onclick=()=>prt(ms,mk);
 }else{
  page(`<h2>🧠 ${esc(D.t)}</h2><button class="btn" id="sv">⬇️ تحميل الخريطة الذهنية (PDF)</button><button class="btn alt" id="pr">🖨️ طباعة</button><div class="msg" id="ms">كل فرع = قسم من الكتاب، وكل صندوق = نقطة من نقاطه.</div>`,back);
  const cv=mapCanvas(D);cv.style.cssText="width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;margin-top:10px;background:#fff";app.querySelector(".card").appendChild(cv);
  const ms=document.getElementById("ms"),mk=async()=>pdfFrom(await mapPages(cv));
  document.getElementById("sv").onclick=()=>dl(ms,"خريطة_ذهنية_"+nm+".pdf",mk);document.getElementById("pr").onclick=()=>prt(ms,mk);
 }}
const CRT=["الحرث","التمشيط والكبس والتسوية","التخطيط والتقسيم","التقاوى والبدار والتسطير","طرق الزراعة وحساب التقاوى"];
function crImgNums(s){
 page(`<h2>🖼️ الصور – ${esc(s)}</h2><p style="color:var(--mut);margin:0">صور الجرارات والآلات الزراعية حسب السكاشن (العملي)، اضغط للتكبير.</p><div class="list">${[1,2,3,4,5].map(n=>`<button class="opt">السكشن ${n} – ${CRT[n-1]}<small>${(CRIMG[n]||[]).length} صورة</small></button>`).join("")}</div>`,()=>subject(s));
 btns([1,2,3,4,5],"opt",n=>crGallery(s,n));
}
function crGallery(s,n){
 const L=CRIMG[n]||[];
 page(`<h2>🖼️ السكشن ${n} – ${CRT[n-1]}</h2><div class="msg" id="ms" style="margin:0">اضغط على الصورة لتكبيرها.</div><div class="gal">${L.map((x,i)=>`<div class="t"><img alt="" src="${x[0]}" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);cursor:zoom-in"><div class="cp"><span>${esc(x[1])}</span><button data-i="${i}">⬇️</button></div></div>`).join("")}</div>`,()=>crImgNums(s));
 app.querySelectorAll(".t img").forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>e.parentNode.classList.toggle("big"));
 app.querySelectorAll(".t button").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>dl(document.getElementById("ms"),"سكشن"+n+"_صورة"+(+b.dataset.i+1)+".jpg",async()=>(await fetch(L[+b.dataset.i][0])).blob()));
}


